  "body": "Hello, \r\ni've got the problem, that i cant use the email service of synapse.\r\nThe log gives the following error:\r\n`<<< 504 5.5.2 <Users@server>: Sender address rejected: need fully-qualified address`\r\n\"server\" is the name of my server and should be instead \"domain.tld\" als configured in /etc/matrix-synapse/conf.d/server_name.yaml or /etc/matrix-synapse/homeserver.yaml (\"server_name\").\r\n\r\nI think this is a bug. Or is it?\r\n\r\nI've already purged the package and dropped the postgres database. It did not help.\r\n\r\nI am using the prebuild package https://matrix-org.github.io/synapse/latest/setup/installation.html#matrixorg-packages\r\nUbuntu 20.04\r\n\r\nThanks",
